From: Antigravity Agent <antigravity@google.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8998-xiaomi-sagit: enable modem, slpi and adsp remoteprocs

Enable Qualcomm Hexagon remoteproc nodes (mss-pil, slpi-pas, and adsp-pas)
on Xiaomi Mi 6 (sagit) with their vendor firmware paths.
This enables the modem DSP, which is required for WCN3990 Wi-Fi and audio.

Signed-off-by: Antigravity Agent <antigravity@google.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998-xiaomi-sagit.dts | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998-xiaomi-sagit.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998-xiaomi-sagit.dts
@@ -210,3 +210,18 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&mss_pil {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/msm8998/xiaomi/mba.mbn", "qcom/msm8998/xiaomi/modem.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&slpi_pas {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/msm8998/xiaomi/slpi_v2.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&adsp_pas {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/msm8998/xiaomi/adsp.mbn";
+	status = "okay";
+};
-- 
